Backend API Structure for Dynamic Permissions System
📋 Required API Endpoints
1. Routes API
GET /api/routes

Returns all routes with their permissions, labels, and hierarchy.

json
[
  {
    "id": "dashboard",
    "path": "/admin/dashboard",
    "label": "Dashboard",
    "icon": "LayoutDashboard",
    "permissions": [],
    "isSystemRoute": true,
    "isVisible": true,
    "order": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "users",
    "path": "/admin/users",
    "label": "Users",
    "icon": "Users",
    "permissions": ["view_users"],
    "isSystemRoute": true,
    "isVisible": true,
    "order": 2,
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "users-list",
        "path": "/admin/users",
        "label": "All Users",
        "icon": "Users",
        "permissions": ["view_users"]
      },
      {
        "id": "users-create",
        "path": "/admin/users/new",
        "label": "Add User",
        "icon": "Plus",
        "permissions": ["create_users"]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "courses",
    "path": "/admin/courses",
    "label": "Courses",
    "icon": "BookOpen",
    "permissions": ["view_courses"],
    "isSystemRoute": true,
    "order": 3,
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "courses-list",
        "path": "/admin/courses",
        "label": "All Courses",
        "permissions": ["view_courses"]
      },
      {
        "id": "courses-create",
        "path": "/admin/courses/new",
        "label": "Add Course",
        "permissions": ["create_courses"]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "settings",
    "path": "/admin/settings",
    "label": "Settings",
    "icon": "Settings",
    "permissions": ["view_settings"],
    "isSystemRoute": true,
    "order": 99
  }
]
2. Permission Groups API
GET /api/permission-groups

Returns permission groups with all permissions inside each group.

json
